:INFO
Art. 72 Register of products
1 The Notification Authority shall maintain a register of substances and preparations that fall within the scope of the following Ordinances:
a. this Ordinance;
b. the ORRChem;
c. the Biocidal Products Ordinance of 18 May 2005;
d. the Plant Protection Products Ordinance of 20 August 2025;
e. Fertilisers Ordinance of 1 November 2023.
1bis The data collected in accordance with Article 27 paragraph 1 TabPO on preparations shall also be entered in the register of products.
2 The register shall be compiled on the basis of data:
a. that has been collected or produced by a Swiss authority under one of the ordinances cited in paragraph 1 or 1bis;
b. that is made available by foreign authorities or by international organisations.
|

